# 8. OpenVAS / Greenbone

**OpenVAS** is an open vulnerability scanning technology associated with the **Greenbone** vulnerability-management ecosystem.

It can be used to:

- Scan systems
- Detect known vulnerabilities
- Identify configuration weaknesses
- Generate vulnerability reports
- Prioritize findings

You may encounter the name:

> **Greenbone Vulnerability Management (GVM)**

in modern environments.

### Exam Memory

